```
## .NET 11 Preview 3 Release Notes

This PR adds the initial release notes for .NET 11 Preview 3.

### Changes included

**VMR diff**: [`v11.0.0-preview.2.26159.112`...`release/11.0.1xx-preview3`](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet/compare/v11.0.0-preview.2.26159.112...release/11.0.1xx-preview3)

**Changes**: ~100 notable PRs across 10 components (see `changes.json`)

### Files written

| File | Component | Status |
|------|-----------|--------|
| `README.md` | Index | ✅ Draft |
| `runtime.md` | Runtime / JIT / GC | ✅ Draft |
| `libraries.md` | BCL / Libraries | ✅ Draft |
| `aspnetcore.md` | ASP.NET Core | ✅ Draft |
| `efcore.md` | EF Core | ✅ Draft |
| `sdk.md` | SDK | ✅ Draft |
| `csharp.md` | C# / Roslyn | ✅ Draft |
| `msbuild.md` | MSBuild | ✅ Draft |
| `nuget.md` | NuGet | ✅ Draft |
| `fsharp.md` | F# | ✅ Draft (bug fixes only) |
| `winforms.md` | Windows Forms | ✅ Stub + bug fixes |
| `wpf.md` | WPF | ✅ Stub |
| `visualbasic.md` | Visual Basic | ✅ Stub |
| `dotnetmaui.md` | .NET MAUI | ✅ Stub |
| `containers.md` | Containers | ✅ Stub |

### Headline features

- **Runtime-async enabled by default** for `net11.0` — biggest runtime story of the preview
- **System.Text.Json cluster**: PascalCase policy, per-member naming, type-level JsonIgnore, generic converters, byref ctors
- **ML-KEM stabilized** — `[Experimental]` removed from post-quantum key encapsulation APIs
- **Zstandard** moved to `System.IO.Compression` namespace
- **ZIP CRC32 validation** on read (integrity checking now automatic)
- **OpenAPI 3.1** in ASP.NET Core
- **Blazor Virtualize** with variable row heights
- **Cosmos DB complex property** querying in EF Core
- **EF Core partial property loading** and `ChangeTracker.GetEntriesForState()`
- **File-based app** tooling: NuGet CLI + Roslyn IDE support

### Reverted PRs excluded

- `ProcessStartOptions` class: [dotnet/runtime #124271](https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/pull/124271) reverted by [#125839](https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/pull/125839)
- NuGet `dotnet nuget why` resolved versions: reverted by [nuget/nuget.client #7212](https://github.com/nuget/nuget.client/pull/7212)
- NuGet CRL/OCSP in verify output: reverted by [nuget/nuget.client #7220](https://github.com/nuget/nuget.client/pull/7220)

### Open items for human review

- [ ] **Runtime-async**: Preview blockquote uses placeholder text — need exact wording from runtime team
- [ ] **Community contributors**: aspnetcore community contributor list needs verification against full git log
- [ ] **Release version string**: Runtime version for Preview 3 is not yet tagged — `11.0.0-preview.3` used as placeholder
- [ ] **Code samples**: Some API samples (ARM64 intrinsics, parameterized CRC) should be reviewed for correctness
- [ ] **EF Core breaking change**: Confirm exact exception type for `MigrationsNotFoundException`

### Notes

- `release-notes-gen` tool was unavailable (no auth token in this environment); `changes.json` was assembled manually from git log across component repos
- This is an initial draft — accuracy of specific PR numbers should be spot-checked
```

